ZINDAAN MEIN HAYE BAALI SAKINA GUZAR GAYI<br>
<br>
 ASGHAR KE DIL KE SAATH SAKINA KA DIL GAYA,<br>
 ABBAS KYA GAYE KE ZAMANA BADAL GAYA,<br>
 GAUHAR CHHINE TAMANCHE LAGE KURTA JAL GAYA,<br>
 NOOR-E-NAZAR HUSSAIN KI YON DAR BADAR GAYI<br>
<br>
HOGI REHAYI KAB MERI ZINDAANE SHAAM SE,<br>
 FARYAAD ISKI THI YE H I AALI MUQAAM SE,<br>
 DIL DOOBTA HAI SHIMRE SITAMGAR KE NAAM SE,<br>
 DUKH SEHTE SEHTE HAYE SAKINA BHI MARGAYI<br>
<br>
BHOOLA NA JAYEGA KABHI BIBI TERA SUKHAN,<br>
 BAZO KHULYENGE AUR YE KHUL JAYEGI GI RASAN,<br>
 AB CHHOOT KAR YE AAL-E-NABI JAYENGI WATAN,<br>
 IS KAMSINI MEIN KITNA BADA KAM KARGAYI<br>
<br>
BIBI SAKINA KARTI HAIN ZAINAB SE YE FUGHAAN,<br>
 HOAN PYAAS SE NIDHAAL TO ANKHON MEIN HAI DHUWAAN,<br>
 DHOONDON BATAO KIS TARHA MEIN BAAP KO KAHAN,<br>
 ZALIM DHIKHAYI DETE HAIN MUJH KO JIDHAR GAYI<br>
<br>
DIL MEIN KHYALE AKBAR-O-ASGHAR LIYE HUE,<br>
 PALKON PE AANSOWAON KA SAMANDAR LIYE HUE,<br>
 IQBAL DIL PE DAAG BAHANTTAR LIYE HUE,<br>
 MAANINDE NOOR QHAIDE SITAM MEIN BIKHAR GAYI